# Hello Needle native components

Hello Needle @PROJECT_VERSION@ uses Qt @qt_version@ Core, Gui, Widgets and SVG. SQLite stores matches and diagnostics during a search. Poppler supplies `pdftotext` and `pdftoppm`. Antiword supplies the `antiword` command and its character maps. The Windows Setup installer and macOS disk image include the native runtime, Qt platform plugins, document tools and Spanish Qt translations. FreeBSD and Linux obtain these components through their package managers.

The application and worker are distributed under GPL-3.0-or-later. The original Clapgrep attribution appears in `NOTICE.md`. The Rust code linked into the worker is inventoried in `LICENSES/rust/DEPENDENCIES.md`. Individual notices and license texts are available offline under `LICENSES/`. Each CI binary has a companion source archive containing the exact project revision, build scripts and vendored Rust dependencies. The installers also include a native runtime inventory and ship with the matching component sources and build recipes.

`BUILD-ENVIRONMENT.json` in a native package identifies its Git revision, operating system, linked libraries, converter versions, and the installed versions of the following packages. Qt's translation package supplies standard Spanish widget and dialog text.

| Component | Upstream source |
| --- | --- |
| Qt libraries, native plugins and translations | [Qt Base](https://code.qt.io/cgit/qt/qtbase.git/) · [Qt SVG](https://code.qt.io/cgit/qt/qtsvg.git/) · [Qt Translations](https://code.qt.io/cgit/qt/qttranslations.git/) |
| SQLite embedded database | [SQLite source](https://www.sqlite.org/src/) |
| Poppler command-line utilities | [Poppler source](https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/poppler/poppler) |
| Antiword and its character maps | [Antiword source and distribution revisions](https://sources.debian.org/src/antiword/) |

The package revision identifies the distribution's own patches and build files. These catalogs make those materials available.

| Distribution | Sources and build recipes |
| --- | --- |
| Ubuntu 24.04 | [Qt Base](https://packages.ubuntu.com/source/noble/qt6-base) · [Qt SVG](https://packages.ubuntu.com/source/noble/qt6-svg) · [Qt translations](https://packages.ubuntu.com/source/noble/qt6-translations) · [Poppler](https://packages.ubuntu.com/source/noble/poppler) · [Antiword](https://packages.ubuntu.com/source/noble/antiword) |
| FreeBSD | [Qt Base](https://cgit.freebsd.org/ports/tree/devel/qt6-base) · [Qt SVG](https://cgit.freebsd.org/ports/tree/graphics/qt6-svg) · [Qt translations](https://cgit.freebsd.org/ports/tree/devel/qt6-translations) · [Poppler utilities](https://cgit.freebsd.org/ports/tree/graphics/poppler-utils) · [Antiword](https://cgit.freebsd.org/ports/tree/textproc/antiword) |
| MSYS2 UCRT64 | [Qt Base](https://packages.msys2.org/base/mingw-w64-qt6-base) · [Qt SVG](https://packages.msys2.org/base/mingw-w64-qt6-svg) · [Qt translations](https://packages.msys2.org/base/mingw-w64-qt6-translations) · [Poppler](https://packages.msys2.org/base/mingw-w64-poppler) · [Antiword](https://packages.msys2.org/base/mingw-w64-antiword) |
| MacPorts build inputs for macOS | [Qt Base](https://ports.macports.org/port/qt6-qtbase/) · [Qt SVG](https://ports.macports.org/port/qt6-qtsvg/) · [Qt translations](https://ports.macports.org/port/qt6-qttranslations/) · [Poppler](https://ports.macports.org/port/poppler/) · [Antiword](https://ports.macports.org/port/antiword/) |
